<title>USA: Western Gas to offer 5.6 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Western Gas to offer 5.6 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Gas Resources Inc said on Monday it offered 5.63 million common shares at $16.25 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it offered 5.5 million shares, and an unidentified selling stockholder offered the remaining 130,000.</p>
<p>The underwriting syndicate, managed by Goldman Sachs, Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette and Petrie Parkman &amp; Co., were granted an option to buy up to an additional 825,000 shares from the company, and another 19,500 from the stockholder.</p>
<p>The compamy will use proceeds to repay some of its debt.</p>
</text>
